# Ignore docs/ contents rather than docs/ itself: git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a re-include below would never match. Feature artefacts
# and protocol references are part of the review record (see the required
# workflow in CLAUDE.md) and must reach the PR.
docs/*
!docs/features/
!docs/reference/
.coverage
.remember
FORK_INTEGRATION_ARCHITECTURE_PLAN.md
